@startuml
' title Extended Metadata Workflow in d-OSP
skinparam monochrome true

actor "Researcher A" as A
actor "Researcher B" as B
participant "d-OSP Platform" as Platform
participant "IPFS" as IPFS
participant "Blockchain" as Blockchain

== Original Artifact Upload ==
A -> Platform : Upload original artifact + metadata (JSON-LD)
Platform -> IPFS : Submit metadata, receive CID\ntied to artifact
IPFS --> Platform : Return CID for artifact
Platform -> Blockchain : Anchor CID + metadata hash\non blockchain account
Blockchain --> Platform : Confirm transaction
Platform -> A : Confirm upload success

== Derived Artifact Upload ==
B -> Platform : Download original artifact\nvia CID reference
B -> B : Modify artifact (create derivative)
B -> Platform : Upload derived artifact + metadata
Platform -> IPFS : Submit derived metadata\nreceive new CID
IPFS --> Platform : Return derived artifact CID
Platform -> Blockchain : Anchor derived CID + \nprov:wasDerivedFrom (original CID) + metadata hash
Blockchain --> Platform : Confirm transaction
Platform -> B : Confirm upload success

' ' == Provenance Linkage ==
' note right of Platform
'   Metadata includes:
'   - schema:contributor (ORCID)
'   - schema:dateCreated
'   - prov:wasDerivedFrom
' end note

@enduml
